  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "53beb2e1-636f-44ae-9e17-38fa241eadd2",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a palavra em espanhol e ligue ao apoio em português.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "4973214c-9216-4e79-9ec2-408ff51cc6c5",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a reação dela ao olhar o celular.</p><p><strong>Preocupada.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Preocupada.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/7d853d901cd240578d4c8a514fb192e8_l04b01-preocupada-contexto.png?Expires=1794099550&Signature=ErlJBG4Ddwm5NgVT9Q98IQX8D6iZoRVtaMkHQnIlTiQSObjrylimNETGZ7q~0KourXQfXXv1sI2SaNgOFlzJDOuOGsi~pLqAJIdDJAT17D5w0OTMf0Ur16rpKjpWFS14BKOS4-mH-E~t15w~5kfT7ys0b0mSFuz~0DYfafs4unLzLH61jKRhS9REdV~wnLX8pkj0Tq8voYUVkCU8rOc4MVjlpwT5hZi0X30CdD3AbDTIescio7X-Jdip~zOtV7lc8Dny5V~gfAbGSb~jznt-IirWcG1hxsdUjIL70J90QFbehFABcxoPNU5zCGpqZb2jonkIf6yOleIuGX2liz4BpA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
